    "payload": {
      "artifact_ids": [],
      "call_id": "call_tyWYBMe9YE70lhCxrmAHRePT",
      "content": "# Text utilities contract\r\nImplement two existing independent interfaces, preserving signatures and verification files.\r\ntext.Slug.of(String): reject null with IllegalArgumentException. Normalize NFKD, discard Unicode combining marks,\r\nlowercase with Locale.ROOT, replace each run outside ASCII a-z/0-9 with one hyphen, strip edge hyphens.\r\nAn empty or punctuation-only input returns the empty string.\r\ntext.Header.parse(String): reject null, CR/LF anywhere, no colon, or an invalid header name with IllegalArgumentException.\r\nSplit at the FIRST colon. Trim both parts; lowercase name with Locale.ROOT. Name must match [a-z][a-z0-9-]*.\r\nReturn a one-entry Map<String,String>; value can be empty and can contain additional colons. Preserve value case.\r\nRead tests/GateTest.java for boundary checks. Run powershell.exe -NoProfile -File ./verify.ps1 after integrating both components.\r\n",
      "error_code": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "status": "success"
    },
    "created_at": 1790489326.7712836
  },
